        <li><strong>Before arbitration</strong> - Helping you present your position and advising on what matters most</li>
        <li><strong>After resolution</strong> - Reviewing the final award and handling all court filing</li>
      </ul><a href="/go/qa-fixture?consult=1" class="co-branded-page__primary-cta co-branded-page__primary-cta--light co-branded-page__primary-cta--arrow">Request a Consultation <img class="button-arrow-icon" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3csvg%20width='16'%20height='17'%20viewBox='0%200%2016%2017'%20fill='none'%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3e%3cg%20clip-path='url(%23clip0_2014_64)'%3e%3cpath%20d='M7.29297%200.832529C7.65908%200.466413%208.23809%200.44382%208.63086%200.76417L8.70703%200.832529L15.707%207.83253C15.7532%207.8787%2015.7946%207.92946%2015.8311%207.9839C15.8586%208.02494%2015.8816%208.068%2015.9023%208.11183C15.923%208.15532%2015.9418%208.19992%2015.9561%208.24659C15.9612%208.26332%2015.9645%208.28045%2015.9688%208.29737C15.9881%208.37498%2016%208.45598%2016%208.53956C16%208.62256%2015.9878%208.70269%2015.9688%208.77979C15.9646%208.79673%2015.9611%208.81384%2015.9561%208.83058C15.9421%208.87646%2015.9244%208.92057%2015.9043%208.96339C15.8833%209.0081%2015.859%209.05143%2015.8311%209.09327C15.8185%209.11211%2015.8048%209.13005%2015.791%209.14796C15.765%209.18173%2015.738%209.21563%2015.707%209.24659L8.70703%2016.2466C8.31654%2016.637%207.68346%2016.637%207.29297%2016.2466C6.90248%2015.8561%206.90256%2015.2231%207.29297%2014.8325L12.5859%209.53956H1C0.447793%209.53956%200.000126768%209.09174%200%208.53956C0%207.98728%200.447715%207.53956%201%207.53956H12.5859L7.29297%202.24659L7.22461%202.17042C6.90429%201.77769%206.92697%201.19865%207.29297%200.832529Z'%20fill='%233E4059'/%3e%3c/g%3e%3cdefs%3e%3cclipPath%20id='clip0_2014_64'%3e%3crect%20width='16'%20height='17'%20fill='white'/%3e%3c/clipPath%3e%3c/defs%3e%3c/svg%3e" alt=""></a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="co-branded-page__pricing" aria-labelledby="co-branded-pricing-title">
    <h2 id="co-branded-pricing-title">Find Your Track</h2>
    <div class="pricing-section__grid co-branded-page__pricing-grid">
      <article class="pricing-card">
        <div class="pricing-card__content">
          <div class="pricing-card__header">
            <p class="pricing-card__name">Parenting Track</p>
            <!--v-if-->
          </div>
          <div class="pricing-card__pricing">
            <!--v-if-->
            <div class="pricing-card__price">
              <!--v-if--><span class="pricing-card__current-price"><!--v-if--><span class="pricing-card__amount">$3,500</span><span class="pricing-card__cadence">/ per person</span></span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="pricing-card__description">Guided by parenting specialists and neutral mediators who help you create a sustainable parenting plan.</p>
          <div class="pricing-card__includes">
            <p class="pricing-card__includes-title"> For cases involving </p>
            <ul class="pricing-card__features">
              <li class="pricing-card__feature">Custody and parenting time schedules</li>
              <li class="pricing-card__feature">Decision-making and co-parenting plans</li>
              <li class="pricing-card__feature">Holiday and vacation planning</li>
              <li class="pricing-card__feature">Child support calculations</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!--v-if-->
        <div class="pricing-card__note"><span class="pricing-card__note-label">Best for</span>
          <p>Couples with children or ongoing parenting responsibilities. If you also have property or assets to divide, you'll need the combined track.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="pricing-card">
        <div class="pricing-card__content">
          <div class="pricing-card__header">
            <p class="pricing-card__name">Financial Track</p><span class="pricing-card__badge">Popular</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pricing-card__pricing">
            <!--v-if-->
            <div class="pricing-card__price">
              <!--v-if--><span class="pricing-card__current-price"><!--v-if--><span class="pricing-card__amount">$4,800</span><span class="pricing-card__cadence">/ per person</span></span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="pricing-card__description">Guided by CDFA® financial experts and neutral mediators who help you navigate complex financial decisions.</p>
          <div class="pricing-card__includes">
            <p class="pricing-card__includes-title"> For cases involving </p>
            <ul class="pricing-card__features">
              <li class="pricing-card__feature">Property division and asset distribution</li>
              <li class="pricing-card__feature">Business ownership and valuation</li>
              <li class="pricing-card__feature">Retirement accounts and pensions</li>
              <li class="pricing-card__feature">Spousal support calculations</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!--v-if-->
        <div class="pricing-card__note"><span class="pricing-card__note-label">Best for</span>
          <p>Couples with property, assets, or spousal support to resolve. If you also have children needing a parenting support plan, you'll need the combined track.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="pricing-card pricing-card--featured">
        <div class="pricing-card__content">
          <div class="pricing-card__header">
            <p class="pricing-card__name">Parenting + Financial</p><span class="pricing-card__badge">Save $2,000 Each</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pricing-card__pricing">
            <!--v-if-->
            <div class="pricing-card__price">
              <!--v-if--><span class="pricing-card__current-price"><!--v-if--><span class="pricing-card__amount">$5,990</span><span class="pricing-card__cadence">/ per person</span></span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="pricing-card__description">Combines expert parenting and CDFA® financial guidance—with neutral mediation and arbitration.</p>
          <div class="pricing-card__includes">
            <p class="pricing-card__includes-title"> For cases involving </p>
            <ul class="pricing-card__features">
              <li class="pricing-card__feature">Child custody, schedules, and co-parenting</li>
              <li class="pricing-card__feature">Property division and asset distribution</li>
              <li class="pricing-card__feature">Businesses, pensions, retirement accounts</li>
              <li class="pricing-card__feature">Spousal and child support calculations</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!--v-if-->
        <div class="pricing-card__note"><span class="pricing-card__note-label">Best for</span>
          <p>Couples who have both assets to divide and children needing support arrangements – includes both tracks with significant savings.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
    <p class="co-branded-page__pricing-note">For higher-conflict or complex cases requiring extended support, the Solagree-COMPASS program is available.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="co-branded-page__questions" aria-labelledby="co-branded-questions-title">
    <div class="co-branded-page__questions-copy">
      <h2 id="co-branded-questions-title">Common Questions</h2>
      <div class="co-branded-page__questions-intro">
        <p>Solagree offers a structured alternative to traditional divorce litigation - combining expert financial guidance, mediation, and binding arbitration.</p>
        <p>Our process is designed for couples who can't agree on everything but want to avoid lengthy court battles and reach resolution efficiently.</p>
      </div><a href="/go/qa-fixture?consult=1" class="co-branded-page__primary-cta co-branded-page__primary-cta--light">Request a Consultation
        <!--v-if-->
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="co-branded-page__questions-accordion">
      <details class="co-branded-page__accordion-item" open="">
        <summary><span>How do I get my spouse to agree to Solagree?</span><span class="co-branded-page__accordion-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
        <div class="co-branded-page__accordion-content">
          <p>Here are a few approaches:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Share this page so they can explore Solagree on their own</li>
            <li>Focus on the benefits - faster resolution, less conflict, predictable costs</li>
            <li>Connect them with their own advisor - We can help both spouses find appropriate professional support</li>
            <li>Schedule a consultation to discuss the best strategy for your situation, and we'll help you navigate next steps.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </details>
      <details class="co-branded-page__accordion-item">
        <summary><span>Do we need attorneys?</span><span class="co-branded-page__accordion-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
        <p>While not required, we recommend both parties work with independent attorneys who can provide legal guidance throughout the process. We can refer you to network attorneys who work with Solagree.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="co-branded-page__accordion-item">
        <summary><span>Is the arbitration binding?</span><span class="co-branded-page__accordion-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
        <p>Yes, in most states. The arbitration award becomes a legally binding resolution that can be filed with the court without appearing.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="co-branded-page__accordion-item">
        <summary><span>Are payment plans available?</span><span class="co-branded-page__accordion-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
        <p>Yes. Payment plan options are available. Schedule a consultation to discuss the best payment structure for your situation.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="co-branded-page__accordion-item">
        <summary><span>What happens after the Solagree process?</span><span class="co-branded-page__accordion-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
        <p>The final agreement or arbitration award is filed with the court to make it legally binding. In most cases, no courtroom appearance is required.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="co-branded-page__next-steps" aria-labelledby="co-branded-next-steps-title">
    <div class="co-branded-page__section-heading">
      <h2 id="co-branded-next-steps-title">Your Next Steps</h2>
      <p>The first step is a conversation. We'll discuss your situation and help you understand the right path forward.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="co-branded-page__next-steps-grid">
      <div class="co-branded-page__next-steps-card">
        <h3>Let's Talk About Your Situation</h3>
        <p>Request a consultation to learn more about Solagree and discuss whether it's the right approach for your case.</p><a href="/go/qa-fixture?consult=1" class="co-branded-page__primary-cta co-branded-page__primary-cta--light">Request a Consultation
          <!--v-if-->
        </a>
      </div><img class="co-branded-page__next-steps-image" src="/images/co-branded-next-steps.webp" alt="A close-up view of a blonde woman wearing a crisp white button-down shirt, holding a black smartphone to her ear while listening intently during a call.">
    </div>
  </section>
  <footer class="co-branded-page__footer">
    <div class="co-branded-page__footer-inner">
      <div class="co-branded-page__footer-contact"><strong>Jamie Rivera</strong><span>Rivera Mediation LLC</span>
        <div class="co-branded-page__footer-contact-lines"><span>Phone: 415-555-1234</span><span>Email: jamie@rivera.test</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="co-branded-page__footer-solagree"><span class="co-branded-page__footer-logo" aria-label="Solagree"></span><a href="https://solagree.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Learn more: solagree.com</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="co-branded-page__footer-bottom">
      <nav class="co-branded-page__footer-legal" aria-label="Legal links"><a href="/legal/terms-of-service">Terms of Service</a><a href="/legal/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a><a href="/legal/accessibility">Accessibility</a></nav>
      <p>© 2026 Solagree, LLC. All Rights Reserved.</p>
      <p>Solagree® is not a law firm and does not provide legal advice. We connect clients with independent professionals.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>
</article>
<div class="consult-modal-stub" data-open="false" data-page-type="standard"></div>"
`;

exports[`CommonQuestionsSection > HTML 1`] = `
"<section id="common-questions" class="common-questions-section" aria-labelledby="common-questions-title">
  <div class="common-questions-section__inner">
    <div class="common-questions-section__copy">
      <h2 id="common-questions-title" class="common-questions-section__title"> Common Questions </h2>
      <div class="common-questions-section__intro">
        <p> Solagree offers a structured alternative to traditional divorce litigation - combining expert financial guidance, mediation, and binding arbitration. </p>
        <p> Our process is designed for couples who can't agree on everything but want to avoid lengthy court battles and reach resolution efficiently. </p>
      </div><a href="#quiz" class="common-questions-section__cta" size="sm"> Is Solagree right for you? </a>
    </div>
    <div class="u-accordion-stub base-accordion common-questions-section__accordion" data-default-value="how-do-i-get-my-spouse-on-board-with-solagree" ui="[object Object]" collapsible="">
      <section data-value="how-do-i-get-my-spouse-on-board-with-solagree">
        <header><span class="base-accordion__label"><span class="base-accordion__number" aria-hidden="true">1. </span> How do I get my spouse to agree?</span><span class="base-accordion__indicator" aria-hidden="true">-</span></header>
        <div>
          <p class="base-accordion__text"><a href="/book-a-solagree-consult">Schedule a consultation</a> to discuss the best approach for your situation, and we'll help you navigate next steps.</p>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section data-value="how-is-solagree-different-from-traditional-divorce">
        <header><span class="base-accordion__label"><span class="base-accordion__number" aria-hidden="true">2. </span> How is Solagree Different?</span><span class="base-accordion__indicator" aria-hidden="true">+</span></header>
        <div>
          <p class="base-accordion__text">Solagree is entirely virtual with a structured three-phase process: expert information gathering, mediation, and arbitration to finalize your binding document. Both parties are bound from the start to complete the process, so you're more assured to reach resolution. You work with professional neutrals (not judges), and the fees are predictable.</p>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section data-value="do-we-both-need-attorneys">
        <header><span class="base-accordion__label"><span class="base-accordion__number" aria-hidden="true">3. </span> Do we both need attorneys?</span><span class="base-accordion__indicator" aria-hidden="true">+</span></header>
        <div>
          <p class="base-accordion__text">Not necessarily required, but recommended. We can connect you with network attorneys who are versed in handling Solagree cases, or you can work with your own attorney. Having legal guidance helps protect your interests throughout the process.</p>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section data-value="is-the-arbitration-binding">
        <header><span class="base-accordion__label"><span class="base-accordion__number" aria-hidden="true">4. </span> Is the arbitration binding?</span><span class="base-accordion__indicator" aria-hidden="true">+</span></header>
        <div>
          <p class="base-accordion__text">All processes must be adapted to your state’s legal requirements, and for this reason we always recommend a consult with one of our network attorneys. You can <a href="/book-a-solagree-consult">request one here</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>"
`;

